imb dangerous cliffs, and brave narrow ledges that push your courage and endurance to the limit. As you ascend, the route becomes steeper, the air thinner, and the challenge greater. Only the most determined hikers will reach the Puncak, where the reward is a breathtaking panoramic view from the top of the world.\n\n✨ Features\n\n⛰️ A full route from basecamp to 4,000 mdpl\n🌿 Scenic biomes: forests, ridges, and rocky cliffs\n🌤️ Dynamic weather and atmospheric effects\n🎯 True summit experience with panoramic views\n👥 Team up with friends or test yourself solo\n\nDo you have what it takes to conquer Mount Atin and stand tall at its peak?","path":"/game/123224294054165-new-obstacle-mount-atin","slug":"123224294054165-new-obstacle-mount-atin","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-961247476f5065be94cf3ff8ccea15c9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3052e5b86251f753c1e3493a803682db/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":57085871,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-04T11:44:28.929Z","creator":{"name":"Vishy Community's","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":125003187618860,"name":"Find Forsaken Morphs","desc":"Welcome to FORSAKEN Morphs!\n\n📜 Try to find all the morphs around this ETERNAL prison, its not as easy as it seems though.. There will be KILLERS in the way blocking you from victory.\n\n🔓 Unlock over 40+ different morphs from forsaken\n🔴 Escape KILLERS such as 1x1x1x1, Guest 666 and Sonic.EXE\n\nTags: Forsaken, Gubby, Forsaken Roleplay, Morphs, Find The Morph\n\nCredits: This game is FANMADE & ALL CREDITS to the Forsaken Dev Team, contact us first if there are any issues please!","path":"/game/125003187618860-find-forsaken-morphs","slug":"125003187618860-find-forsaken-morphs","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f092c7afad75008f85e3258a704a445e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c1b4d0be9959090ca32844e9a6a29a6e/150/150/Im